  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Kill Your F#!@ing Friends… The Rambunctious B@st@rds (To H*ll With Their Hyperbolic Onomatopoeia)!, better known as K.Y.F.F., is a 4-player NES fighting Homebrew. The game, which was developed for the 2011 NintendoAge Campout, features 8 fighting moves and onomatopoeia pop-ups. The game has absolutely no AI at all, so grab some friends and get to fighting!"
    }
